{"pull": {"id": "number:19918", "number": 19918, "title": "KAFKA-19386: Correcting ExpirationReaper thread names from Purgatory", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2025-06-07T00:41:53Z", "closed_at": "2025-06-09T11:10:59Z", "merged_at": "2025-06-09T11:10:59Z", "user": {"login": "apoorvmittal10", "id": 2861565, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjE1NjU=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2861565?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10", "html_url": "https://github.com/apoorvmittal10", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "The PR: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/17636 migrated\nDelayedOperationPurgatory from scala to java, and instatiated\n`expirationReaper` at instance level where `purgatoryName` is still\n`null` hence all expiration threads from different Purgatories has\nincorrect names.\n\n<img width=\"216\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-06-07 at 01 28 58\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fd1b8137-b290-42e0-9a95-258fde5737d2\"\n/>\n\nThe PR fixes the instatiation of ExpirationReaper, in constructor when\n`purgatoryName` is defined.\n\n<img width=\"296\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-06-07 at 01 31 27\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9912311b-ddf6-4554-8e04-d0b8ad208abc\"\n/>\n\nThis issue affects 4.0 version as well, though minor.\n\nReviewers: Chia-Ping Tsai <chia7712@gmail.com>\n", "labels": [{"id": 838330122, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4MzgzMzAxMjI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/core", "name": "core", "color": "ed5a86", "default": false, "description": "Kafka Broker", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 6979675393, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABoAVlAQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/KIP-932", "name": "KIP-932", "color": "DA462F", "default": false, "description": "Queues for Kafka", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7522931565, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwGbTbQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/ci-approved", "name": "ci-approved", "color": "ffffff", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7559660738, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwpdEwg", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/small", "name": "small", "color": "FEF2C0", "default": false, "description": "Small PRs", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/19918"}, "reviews": [], "review_comments": [], "issue_comments": [], "commits": [], "files": [], "timeline": [], "_partial": "search", "_source": "extra-data/github-search/author_apoorvmittal10_is_pr.json"}